&lt;p&gt;Shadcn/ui ships a set of free dashboard component blocks - data tables, sidebar layouts, chart components, and settings forms. These are genuinely excellent components, freely available, and they work well with Next.js App Router. The trade-off: they are components, not a template. You get the individual building blocks, but you assemble the full 9-page dashboard yourself. If you have the time and want full control over the layout, this is the right free starting point.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free and open source&lt;/li&gt;
