&lt;li&gt;Works with Next.js App Router&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Does not include a complete dashboard - you build the pages yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No dark mode implementation out of the box - you wire it up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Estimated build time to a full 9-page dashboard: 2-4 weeks&lt;/li&gt;
